# Frontend (`apps/web`)

- Next.js App Router + React. Read `apps/web/AGENTS.md` before using Next APIs.
- Keep the existing folders: `app/`, `components/`, `features/`, `hooks/`, `services/`, `store/`, `types/`.
- Pages stay thin. Feature logic lives in `features/` or hooks. HTTP calls live in `services/`.
- Functional components. Extract a hook when stateful logic is reused or noisy.
- Do not import Prisma or Fastify internals from the web app.
- Do not add UI libraries, state libraries, or CSS frameworks without approval.
- Verify UI changes in the browser when tools exist; otherwise say what you could not verify.
